{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46864","headline":"夏日原西避暑寄吟友 · 齐己","name":"夏日原西避暑寄吟友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"热烟疎竹古原西，日日乘凉此杖藜。\n闲处雨声随霹雳，旱田人望隔虹霓。\n蝉依独树乾吟苦，鸟忆平川渴过齐。\n别有相招好泉石，瑞花瑶草尽堪携。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46864.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46864","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}